<title>TUNISIA: Tunisian ICF has 2.7 mln dnrs H1 net.</title>
<headline>Tunisian ICF has 2.7 mln dnrs H1 net.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's chemical firm Industries Chimiques du Fluor on Monday said its net profits for the first half of 1996 amounted 2.744 million dinars, nearing a 2.787 million dinars of net profits during the whole 1995 year.</p>
<p>ICF, which has a capital of nine million dinars, is listed at the Tunis Stock Exchange. Its shares were last priced at 59.03 dinars. ($=0.96 dinar)</p>
